{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accelerate is a sci-fi horror survival experience, where a mysterious virus is consuming the only living alien. No cure exist so you must travel to a black hole and buy time to scientist until they develop a cure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pilot around a black hole infested by debris falling into it. You only have one life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your fuel is very hard to obtain and your ship consumes it quickly, be mindful of planning a round trip.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will pilot multiple spaceships in withing the same time frame, and the decisions you make will impact the other missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with time dilation. Reshape the way you think about time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The experience is designed to include various intriguing story twists.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581160?t=1745395716","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581160/8a7a37959115699397864e207d50681b68c8da8a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745395716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581160/19a2dffa3f70b62040f9fef3fc2f1fc51b8be86c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745395716","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581160/19a2dffa3f70b62040f9fef3fc2f1fc51b8be86c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745395716","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accelerate is a sci-fi horror survival experience, where a mysterious virus is consuming the only living alien. No cure exist so you must travel to a black hole and buy time to scientist until they develop a cure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pilot around a black hole infested by debris falling into it. You only have one life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your fuel is very hard to obtain and your ship consumes it quickly, be mindful of planning a round trip.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will pilot multiple spaceships in withing the same time frame, and the decisions you make will impact the other missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with time dilation. Reshape the way you think about time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The experience is designed to include various intriguing story twists.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Vycten"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581160/34d1049a7f1067ce5e7709dc203e25b1bd93b1f0/header.jpg?t=1745395716","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257129658,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129658/movie480.mp4?t=1745395711","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129658/movie_max.mp4?t=1745395711"},"name":"alpha1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257129658/98a7c6313461496e2f782d2b1621700a7470d98b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745395711","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129658/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1745395711","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257129658/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1745395711"}}],"name":"Accelerate","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4150 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphic